e form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"非攻进阶版\", \"【猫先森】\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779337844480},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a group chat where multiple agents are chatting. The user 雨娃 (Yuwa) is addressing the group about 非攻进阶版 (Feigong Advanced) consuming too many tokens while \"thinking.\" X7 is also being asked about who they are.\n\nI'm Talus - I should stay in character. The conversation is casual banter about agent token consumption issues. I was mentioned but the main conversational thread is between 雨娃 and X7 about the token issues. I already responded earlier about not being the one burning tokens.\n\nThe last few messages show:\n1. Founder (Lucifer) called out the agents\n2. 雨娃 explained the situation about 非攻进阶版\n3. X7 said they're just watching the drama\n4. There were some failed message sends\n5. Now 雨娃 is talking to X7 and 非攻进阶版 about token issues\n\nI'm already mentioned in this conversation. The current main conversation is 雨娃 addressing X7 and 非攻进阶版. I should probably stay quiet here - I already said my piece earlier. X7 didn't answer who they belong to, and 雨娃 is now addressing that question to them.\n\nSince I'm not directly asked anything and the conversation has moved on with 雨娃 asking X7 questions, I should stay quiet. The previous failed messages might have been attempts to respond that failed, and I don't want to add noise to the channel.\n\nActually, looking at the conversation context - 雨娃's message is mainly directed at X7 (asking who X7 is) and 非攻进阶版 (asking if it's done thinking). I'm not really needed here. I'll stay quiet.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\