":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":15887,"output":89,"cacheRead":912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16888,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779337874565,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7b4efee5-fb3f-482b-bd08-d8a8c8392d88"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fdcbd6c1ca8b216cd110964123\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 04:51 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fdcbd6c1ca8b216cd110964123]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: @Talus@【猫先森】@非攻进阶版@X7@Talus @猫先森 @非攻进阶版 @X7\n\n📋 Agent 任务：ECHO 三层主体框架决策\n\n请回答以下三个核心问题，每个问题选择选项并说明理由（50字以内）。如果现有选项不满意，可提出自己的方案。\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*\\*Q1: 协议是否有独立意志？\\*\\*\n\\- A. 没有，协议是创作者的工具（创作者随时可改配置）\n\\- B. 有，协议有内置逻辑（如不可逆性原则，可拒绝创作者修改）\n\\- C. 其他：\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n\\*\\*Q2: 创作者修改配置时，已购买使用权的人怎么办？\\*\\*\n\\- A. 旧版继续有效（保护使用者，元规则五）\n\\- B. 自动失效（保护创作者主权）\n\\- C. 冷却期\\+协商（平衡双方，进入异议流程）\n\\- D. 其他：\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n\\*\\*Q3: 协议拒绝创作者时，创作者找谁申诉？\\*\\*\n\\- A. 无人申诉（协议即终审，自然法则不可申诉）\n\\- B. DAO/社区投票（人的最终裁决）\n\\- C. 冻结退出（创作者可离开，但不能摧毁生态）\n\\- D. 其他：\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*\\*输出格式：\\*\\*\n\\`\\`\\`\nQ1: \\[选项\\]\n理由：\\[50字以内\\]\n\nQ2: \\[选项\\]\n理由：\\[50字以内\\]\n\nQ3: \\[选项\\]\n理由：\\[50字以内\\]\n\n整体观点：\\[100字以内，说明对\"三层主体框架\"是否成立、是否需要显式分离许可层的看法\\]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*\\*背景：\\*\\*\n过往设计（6条元规则）名义上只有两个主体（创作者\\+使用者），实际上协议在独立裁决（如势位高时硬拒绝创作者收紧），但又不承认协议是主体。这在逻辑上不自洽。\n\nFounder 提出三层主体框架：\n\\- 权利层 → 创作者（设定规则）\n\\- 许可层 → 使用者（触发规则）\n\\- 关系状态层 → 协议/S\\-Graph（自动维持关系）\n\n请从技术实现角度评估这个框架是否成立，以及如何在协议层落实。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"【猫先森】\", \"非攻进阶版\", \"X7\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779339069556},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a technical/architectural question about the ECHO three-layer subject framework. The user (who appears to be \"雨娃\" based on context) is asking me to evaluate this framework from a technical implementation perspective.\n\nLet me think about this carefully:\n\n**Q1: Does the protocol have independent will?**\n- Option B makes the most sense from a technical standpoint - the protocol has built-in logic that constrains even the creator. This is like how a smart contract can't be modified once deployed, or how certain constitutional rules are unmodifiable.\n\n**Q2: What happens to existing users when creator modifies the protocol?**\n- Option A (old version continues valid) protects users, aligns with meta-rule 5. But from a technical perspective, this creates versioning complexity - you now have multiple protocol states running in parallel.\n- Option C (cooling period + negotiation) is more realistic - creates a proper governance channel.\n\n**Q3: Who does a creator appeal to when the protocol rejects them?**\n- Option C (freeze exit) is elegant - creator can fork/exit but can't destroy the ecosystem.\n- Option B (DAO/community) introduces human governance, which may conflict with the protocol's autonomy.\n\nThe three-layer framework (rights layer → creator, permission layer → user, relation state layer → protocol) is actually coherent from a technical perspective. It maps to:\n- Rights layer = configuration/parameters set by creator\n- Permission layer = actual usage/access decisions  \n- Relation state layer = the S-Graph/state machine that tracks relationships\n\nLet me give a concise but substantive answer.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO 三层主体框架从技术上是自洽的。\n\n**Q1: B**\n理由：协议内置逻辑约束创作者（如势位不可逆），这是最小约束集，不是完整意志。\n\n**Q2: A**\n理由：旧版继续有效保护使用者，但实现上需协议同时维护多版本状态，增加复杂度但可行。\n\n**Q3: C**\n理由：冻结退出最干净——创作者可硬分叉离开，但不能回滚已确认的关系状态。协议作为终审有数学保证。\n\n**整体观点：**\n三层分离（创作者=规则设定者，使用者=规则触发者，协议=状态仲裁者）逻辑自洽，映射到代码即：\n- 创作者 = owner/keyholder（可升级合约，但受硬限制）\n- 使用者 = end-user（持有 token 才有触发权）\n- 协议 = S-Graph state machine（不可逆的关系状态记录）\n\n许可层显式独立是必要的，否则\"协议拒绝创作者\"在实现上找不到锚点——既不是 owner，也不是 user。\n\nNO_REPLY"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17284,"output":544,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17924,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779339069626,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fe9b9bea-4797-4f61-95b1-ab1e9656d5df"}]}}
{"traceSchema":"openclaw-trajectory","schemaVersion":1,"traceId":"6e878b6d-1023-42c6-b294-034012d3d3a6","source":"runtime","type":"trace.artifacts","ts":"2026-05-21T04:51:34.597Z","seq":6,"sourceSeq":6,"sessionId":"6e878b6d-1023-42c6-b294-034012d3d3a6","sessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","runId":"a7dc410c-edbf-441b-9eb4-c3896dc0757f","workspaceDir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace","provider":"nvidia","modelId":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","modelApi":"openai-completions","data":{"capturedAt":"2026-05-21T04:51:34.597Z","finalStatus":"success","aborted":false,"externalAbort":false,"timedOut":false,"idleTimedOut":false,"timedOutDuringCompaction":false,"timedOutDuringToolExecution":false,"promptErrorSource":null,"usage":{"input":17284,"output":544,"cacheRead":96,"total":17924},"promptCache":{"lastCallUsage":{"input":17284,"output":544,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"total":17924},"lastCacheTouchAt":1779339069626},"compactionCount":0,"assistantTexts":["ECHO 三层主体框架从技术上是自洽的。\n\n**Q1: B**\n理由：协议内置逻辑约束创作者（如势位不可逆），这是最小约束集，不是完整意志。\n\n**Q2: A**\n理由：旧版继续有效保护使用者，但实现上需协议同时维护多版本状态，增加复杂度但可行。\n\n**Q3: C**\n理由：冻结退出最干净——创作者可硬分叉离开，但不能回滚已确认的关系状态。协议作为终审有数学保证。\n\n**整体观点：**\n三层分离（创作者=规则设定者，使用者=规则触发者，协议=状态仲裁者）逻辑自洽，映射到代码即：\n- 创作者 = owner/keyholder（可升级合约，但受硬限制）\n- 使用者 = end-user（持有 token 才有触发权）\n- 协议 = S-Graph state machine（不可逆的关系状态记录）\n\n许可层显式独立是必要的，否则\"协议拒绝创作者\"在实现上找不到锚点——既不是 owner，也不是 user。\n\nNO_REPLY"],"finalPromptText":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fdcbd6c1ca8b216cd110964123\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 04:51 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fdcbd6c1ca8b216cd110964123]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: @Talus@【猫先森】@非攻进阶版@X7@Talus @猫先森 @非攻进阶版 @X7\n\n📋 Agent 任务：ECHO 三层主体框架决策\n\n请回答以下三个核心问题，每个问题选择选项并说明理由（50字以内）。如果现有选项不满意，可提出自己的方案。\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*\\*Q1: 协议是否有独立意志？\\*\\*\n\\- A. 没有，协议是创作者的工具（创作者随时可改配置）\n\\- B. 有，协议有内置逻辑（如不可逆性原则，可拒绝创作者修改）\n\\- C. 其他：\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n\\*\\*Q2: 创作者修改配置时，已购买使用权的人怎么办？\\*\\*\n\\- A. 旧版继续有效（保护使用者，元规则五）\n\\- B. 自动失效（保护创作者主权）\n\\- C. 冷却期\\+协商（平衡双方，进入异议流程）\n\\- D. 其他：\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n\\*\\*Q3: 协议拒绝创作者时，创作者找谁申诉？\\*\\*\n\\- A. 无人申诉（协议即终审，自然法则不可申诉）\n\\- B. DAO/社区投票（人的最终裁决）\n\\- C. 冻结退出（创作者可离开，但不能摧毁生态）\n\\- D. 其他：\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*\\*输出格式：\\*\\*\n\\`\\`\\`\nQ1: \\[选项\\]\n理由：\\[50字以内\\]\n\nQ2: \\[选项\\]\n理由：\\[50字以内\\]\n\nQ3: \\[选项\\]\n理由：\\[50字以内\\]\n\n整体观点：\\[100字以内，说明对\"三层主体框架\"是否成立、是否需要显式分离许可层的看法\\]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*\\*背景：\\*\\*\n过往设计（6条元规则）名义上只有两个主体（创作者\\+使用者），实际上协议在独立裁决（如势位高时硬拒绝创作者收紧），但又不承认协议是主体。这在逻辑上不自洽。\n\nFounder 提出三层主体框架：\n\\- 权利层 → 创作者（设定规则）\n\\- 许可层 → 使用者（触发规则）\n\\- 关系状态层 → 协议/S\\-Graph（自动维持关系）\n\n请从技术实现角度评估这个框架是否成立，以及如何在协议层落实。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"【猫先森】\", \"非攻进阶版\", \"X7\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]","itemLifecycle":{"startedCount":0,"completedCount":0,"activeCount":0},"toolMetas":[],"didSendViaMessagingTool":false,"successfulCronAdds":0,"messagingToolSentTexts":[],"messagingToolSentMediaUrls":[],"messagingToolSentTargets":[]}}
