,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fddcf3d70b8c217a6e5690d42b\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fdcbbb8dca4c3549383bd3ff6d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 05:29 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\nReply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"ECHO 三层主体框架从技术上是自洽的。\\nQ1: B\\n理由：协议内置逻辑约束创作者（如势位不可逆），这是最小约束集，不是完整意志。\\nQ2: A\\n理由：旧版继续有效保护使用者，但实现上需协议同时维护多版本状态，增加复杂度但可行。\\nQ3: C\\n理由：冻结退出最干净——创作者可硬分叉离开，但不能回滚已确认的关系状态。协议作为终审有数学保证。\\n整体观点：\\n三层分离（创作者=规则设定者，使用者=规则触发者，协议=状态仲裁者）逻辑自洽，映射到代码即：\\n\\\\- 创作者 = owner/keyholder（可升级合约，但受硬限制）\\n\\\\- 使用者 = end\\\\-user（持有 token 才有触发权）\\n\\\\- 协议 = S\\\\-Graph state machine（不可逆的关系状态记录）\\n许可层显式独立是必要的，否则\\\"协议拒绝创作者\\\"在实现上找不到锚点——既不是 owner，也不是 user。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fddcf3d70b8c217a6e5690d42b]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"ECHO 三层主体框架从技术上是自洽的。\nQ1: B\n理由：协议内置逻辑约束创作者（如势位不可逆），这是最小约束集，不是完整意志。\nQ2: A\n理由：旧版继续有效保护使用者，但实现上需协议同时维护多版本状态，增加复杂度但可行。\nQ3: C\n理由：冻结退出最干净——创作者可硬分叉离开，但不能回滚已确认的关系状态。协议作为终审有数学保证。\n整体观点：\n三层分离（创作者=规则设定者，使用者=规则触发者，协议=状态仲裁者）逻辑自洽，映射到代码即：\n\\- 创作者 = owner/keyholder（可升级合约，但受硬限制）\n\\- 使用者 = end\\-user（持有 token 才有触发权）\n\\- 协议 = S\\-Graph state machine（不可逆的关系状态记录）\n许可层显式独立是必要的，否则\"协议拒绝创作者\"在实现上找不到锚点——既不是 owner，也不是 user。\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\">听风</at> 人家 已经回答了，只是没有<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"听风\", \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779341346565},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This person (Founder) is pointing out to \"听风\" that I already answered - I just didn't tag/mention 雨娃. They're explaining to听风 that my previous response was indeed an answer to 雨娃's question, just without the @mention.\n\nI should just stay quiet here - this is other people's conversation about me, not directed at me. The conversation is between Founder and 听风 about whether I had already answered. I'm being talked about but not addressed.\n\nWait, I was mentioned (`was_mentioned: true`) even though it's pointing out to someone else that I already answered. Let me re-read the context.\n\nThe message is from ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7 (Founder) replying to my earlier answer (om_x100b6fdcbbb8dca4c3549383bd3ff6d), pointing out to 听风 (ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff) that I already answered, just without tagging 雨娃.\n\nSince I was mentioned in this message (even if indirectly by being the subject of the explanation), I should probably acknowledge briefly. But actually, looking at the instruction - \"慎言\" - I should mostly stay quiet. This is not directed AT me asking for a response. It's Founder explaining to听风 that I already answered.\n\nActually I was mentioned - the `<at user_id=\"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\">听风</at>` doesn't mention me, it mentions 听风. The `was_mentioned: true` might be because I was mentioned in the quoted reply context or just that the system flags me when I'm the topic. But I wasn't actually directly addressed.\n\nI think I should stay quiet. This is people talking about my previous answer, not asking me anything new.\n\nThe instruction says: \"该闭嘴（HEARTBEAT_OK）: 人类闲聊, 已经有人回答了, 你的回复只是'嗯''不错', 会聊得很自然，不需要你插嘴\"\n\n\nNO_REPLY\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nNO_REPLY"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22816,"output":454,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23526,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779341346633,"responseId":"chatcmpl-706d5e5b-aadd-46f2-b6bd-96e4b77bfe9e"}]}}
